{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tralalero Tralala, Bombardino Crocodilo, Lirili Larila, Tung Tung Tung Sahur \u2013 do you recognize these unusual characters?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724870/extras/daac97a5149a938f2f1677adc75b82ab.avif?t=1767099400\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724870/extras_big/daac97a5149a938f2f1677adc75b82ab.avif?t=1767099400 width=800 height=172 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MEMOLOGY: ITALIAN BRAINROT</strong> is a new exciting sequel to the famous <strong>MEMOLOGY</strong> game series. In this version, you will not only use your intelligence, but also seriously train your memory, trying to remember all the unique neural network animals of Italian origin!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724870/extras/5cbd858f9d4d61631908944323fc58a4.avif?t=1767099400\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724870/extras_big/5cbd858f9d4d61631908944323fc58a4.avif?t=1767099400 width=800 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have a fascinating journey through the amazing world of virtual creatures, each of which has a special character and unique features. Can you accurately distinguish these characters and name each of them correctly? Let's check your knowledge together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724870/extras/ea122ab7e3f1e904ac9925707de3996b.avif?t=1767099400\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724870/extras_big/ea122ab7e3f1e904ac9925707de3996b.avif?t=1767099400 width=800 height=86 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic test format in the best traditions of the <strong>MEMOLOGY</strong> series;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 fascinating questions of varying degrees of difficulty;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique achievement system with Italian animals;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exciting final result: find out which Italian animal YOU are!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An opportunity to evaluate how much time you've wasted studying these amazing creatures (and whether it was worth it...)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Does this challenge seem easy to you?</strong> Dive into the game and test how well you remember these magical creatures. Good luck on your adventure in the world of Italian animals!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Tung Tung Tung Sahur","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3724870/38173892283eedefc826e29e338438104450aecf.jpg"},{"name":"\u0160pijuniro Golubiro","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3724870/8f0d0702d1948f0aeb9a8e3d30e2199bfdfc7c95.jpg"},{"name":"La Vaca Saturno Saturnita","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3724870/590adfc1070d7d412d8700402ac9f9558a0a41b0.jpg"},{"name":"Tralalero Tralala","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3724870/8acb282bb895c9ccca5934f0cd8143f4944f9a14.jpg"},{"name":"Balerinna Cappucinna","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3724870/2a1753324c0f84f01eb641f37de464c14a34a794.jpg"},{"name":"Bobritto Bandito","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3724870/483fcb5746a641bd4f2321ca8c97a0b1368c4add.jpg"},{"name":"Trulimero Trulicina","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3724870/5cfc5978766861f81405aa8d726e